  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sri Lanka Support Unit Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment is the second phase of an enabling facility. The Sri Lanka Support Unit Phase 2 (SLSU 2) builds on the previous investment and is responsible for managing implementation of the Governance for Growth and subnational programs, managing small grants under the Direct Aid Program (DAP) and providing technical advice across the bilateral program on Monitoring and Evaluation and cross cutting issues, together with the partnerships with The Asia Foundation (TAF) and The International Foundation for Electoral Systems (IFES). SLSU 2 is a flexible modality.</narrative>
  </description>
